Advance + Scenario Level Interview Questions (#DevOps, #Cloud, #CICD)

If you are preparing for AWS | Jenkins | Docker | Kubernetes | Terraform, these questions are asked in real interviews 🔥

🔥 Kubernetes & Containers
 Your pod is in CrashLoopBackOff, how will you troubleshoot?
 What will you do if container CPU spikes suddenly in production?
 Difference between Deployment, DaemonSet and StatefulSet?
 What is Ingress and how will you expose a service securely?
 How do you handle pod-to-pod communication in private cluster?
 Zero downtime deployment – how will you implement?

🔧 Jenkins & CI/CD
 Explain your complete CI/CD pipeline architecture?
 How do you optimize slow pipelines?
 How do you roll back if deployment failed?
 What are multi-branch pipelines and when to use?
 How do you manage credentials in Jenkins securely?
 How do you trigger pipeline automatically for specific branches?

🛠️ Terraform / IaC
 How do you manage multiple environments (dev/qa/prod)?
 What is Terraform state and what problems can happen with state?
What steps will you take when terraform apply fails?
 Remote backend vs local backend – why remote?
 How do you handle drift in infrastructure?
 What are best practices for modules?

🌩️ AWS Cloud & Production
How do you reduce AWS cost without impacting performance?
 What is the difference between ALB, NLB and CLB?
 How will you design VPC for secure production traffic?
 What steps will you take when high latency is seen across regions?
 How do you secure S3 buckets from public access?
 What is Auto Scaling and how will you set policies?

🚨 Troubleshooting & Scenarios
 Application is working locally but failing in Kubernetes – why?
 Deployment stuck in “ImagePullBackOff” – what to check?
 Disk space is full on a node – how to fix?
 DNS failed inside cluster – where to check?
 Pipeline is failing only in production – how to debug?
 User reports intermittent errors – how will you trace root cause?

 Tip:
Most interviews today are real-world troubleshooting.
